      "text": "preferably March.  Dr. Shaheen then discussed an LCME Course Review Template, suggesting that they could",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.3565882047017416,
        "x1": 0.9189495011871937,
        "y1": 0.37045184048739344
      },
      "text": "take each of those items listed and make into an online response and summary.  Discussion followed regarding",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.3725729807458743,
        "x1": 0.941354390063317,
        "y1": 0.38643661653152617
      },
      "text": "availability of various evaluations, questionnaires, etc. for the Course Directors.  Dr. Chaney noted in reference to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.38855775679000704,
        "x1": 0.9158761018241932,
        "y1": 0.4024213925756589
      },
      "text": "the Core Competencies there are so many that are not applicable to first year courses.  Dr. Tresolini responded",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.40454253283413977,
        "x1": 0.9098317264731414,
        "y1": 0.41840616861979163
      },
      "text": "that Dr. Rao is heading up a subcommittee on educational objectives and how well people in the environment",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.4205273088782725,
        "x1": 0.9037909414253983,
        "y1": 0.43439094466392436
      },
      "text": "understand them and how these core competencies are addressed in the curriculum.  She referred to a project",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.4364358295093883,
        "x1": 0.9054040846481822,
        "y1": 0.4502994652950403
      },
      "text": "handled by Linda Fisher of OED.  She looked at all the core competencies and went through the syllabi, then",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.45242060555352104,
        "x1": 0.9312732172947303,
        "y1": 0.466284241339173
      },
      "text": "mapped out where core competencies are addressed and how they are assessed.  It’s a start and would need to be",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.46840538159765377,
        "x1": 0.9452853732638888,
        "y1": 0.48226901738330574
      },
      "text": "run by the course directors.  Dr. Rao said that the course directors would need to be prepped before the LCME site",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.4843901576417865,
        "x1": 0.934251473620047,
        "y1": 0.4982537934274385
      },
      "text": "visit.  Discussion followed regarding placing the Core Competencies in various documents.  The Committee also",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764451569201899,
        "y0": 0.5003749336859192,
        "x1": 0.9391351836958742,
        "y1": 0.5142385694715712
      },
      "text": "agreed that this annual course review form needs to be implemented this school year.  Dr. Tresolini will prepare a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
