        "x1": 0.9421115451388888,
        "y1": 0.5621166421909525
      },
      "text": "appropriate.   Dr. Tresolini explained that the course directors committees would be given a compilation of course",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
